{"schema_version":"1.0","issue_id":"SP-2024-H1","package_id":"architecture-efficiency","draft_version":"v0.1","status":"DRAFT","headline":"Dense Transformerだけではない――2024 H1に広がった設計空間","deck":"Jamba、Mamba-2、BitNet b1.58、LongRoPEは、Transformerを単純に大きくする以外の道を示した。SSM、MoE、低ビット表現、長文脈拡張を、memory・throughput・contextという制約への異なる回答として整理する。","deck_attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","deck_evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-official-index-supplemental-ai21-ja-97a4f32859","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2405-21060v1-34ab887f2a","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-17764v1-cf7e0465e5","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-13753v1-a5ead6bb56","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"}],"blocks":[{"block_id":"constraint-driven","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"2024年上期のarchitecture研究を横断すると、共通しているのは「より大きなdense Transformer」を唯一の解としない姿勢である。JambaはattentionとMamba系state-space model、さらにMoEを組み合わせ、Mamba-2はstate-space dualityを通じてsequence modelの設計を整理した。BitNet b1.58はweight表現を極端に低ビット化し、LongRoPEはposition encoding側から長文脈を拡張した。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-official-index-supplemental-ai21-ja-97a4f32859","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2405-21060v1-34ab887f2a","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-17764v1-cf7e0465e5","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-13753v1-a5ead6bb56","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"}]},{"block_id":"hybrid-sparse","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"Jamba、Mixtral 8x22B、DeepSeek-V2のようなモデルは、全parameterを毎tokenで同じように使うdense設計から離れ、sparse activationやhybrid構成でcapacityと計算量を分離しようとした。ここではarchitectureとserving implementationが密接に結びつくため、理論上のparameter効率と実際のhardware上の速度を同一視できない。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-official-index-supplemental-ai21-ja-97a4f32859","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-official-index-supplemental-mistral-9ae62fe6d3","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:series-deepseek-v2-lineage-42737841bd","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"}]},{"block_id":"memory-context","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"BitNet b1.58はweight memoryと演算表現の制約に、LongRoPEとInfini-attentionはcontext lengthとattention memoryの制約に向き合った。これらは同じ性能指標を改善する研究ではなく、学習・推論時にどこでcostが発生するかを別々の層で組み替える試みである。長いcontextを宣言できることと、その全域で同等の品質を維持できることも分けて評価する必要がある。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-17764v1-cf7e0465e5","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-13753v1-a5ead6bb56","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2404-07143v2-9fe62232b0","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"}]},{"block_id":"paper-boundary","block_type":"CLAIM_BOUNDARY","text":"各paperやvendorが報告するspeedup、memory削減、context length、benchmark結果は、それぞれのmodel・hardware・evaluation setupに依存する。本稿は設計原理の違いを比較するものであり、これらの数値を独立再現済みの共通尺度として扱わない。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-official-index-supplemental-ai21-ja-97a4f32859","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2405-21060v1-34ab887f2a","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-17764v1-cf7e0465e5","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-13753v1-a5ead6bb56","kind":"LIMITATION","evidence_id":"limitation-1"}]},{"block_id":"design-space","block_type":"PARAGRAPH","text":"この半年に確立したのは特定architectureの勝利ではなく、設計空間の再拡大だった。attentionをどう減らすか、どこにsparsityを入れるか、weightを何bitで持つか、contextをどの方法で伸ばすかという選択が、model qualityと同じくらい重要なengineering変数として前面に出た。","attribution_mode":"INFERENCE","evidence_refs":[{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-official-index-supplemental-ai21-ja-97a4f32859","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2405-21060v1-34ab887f2a","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-17764v1-cf7e0465e5","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-arxiv-2402-13753v1-a5ead6bb56","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:item-official-index-supplemental-mistral-9ae62fe6d3","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"},{"evidence_task_id":"evidence:SP-2024-H1:series-deepseek-v2-lineage-42737841bd","kind":"EVENT","evidence_id":"event-1"}]}],"must_cover_coverage":[{"requirement":"architecture versus implementation optimization","block_ids":["hybrid-sparse","paper-boundary"]},{"requirement":"claimed context length versus effective quality","block_ids":["memory-context","paper-boundary"]},{"requirement":"research-paper results remain author claims","block_ids":["paper-boundary"]}],"boundary_coverage":[{"requirement":"Primary-source verification establishes the bounded facts recorded here; it does not convert vendor, project, or author evaluations into independent reproduction.","block_ids":["paper-boundary"]}],"late_breaking_acknowledged":false}